I've not seen the "expected 2 pieces" warnings, but I see two basic problems:

The map file should have just three columns: marker, chromosome, position. You need to remove at least the first column with row numbers. I attach an version that works.

Second, you need to include genotype codes in the control file. In the call to write_control_file(), use the following:'

     geno_codes=list("A/A"=1, "A/B"=2, "B/B"=3)

karl

